@startuml
title Cupid System - Component Diagram

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false

actor User

package "Cupid App" {

  [Web UI\n(Thymeleaf)] as UI

  component "Profile" as ProfileComp {
    [Profile Lifecycle\n(Allaine)]
    [Profile Pictures\n(Tanzim)]
  }

  component "Matching\n(Jay)" as MatchingComp
  component "Messaging\n(Hung)" as MessagingComp

  component "Shared\n(Tanzim)" as SharedComp {
    [Home]
    [Settings / Preferences UI]
    [Global Exception Handler]
  }

  database "MySQL" as DB
}

User --> UI

UI --> ProfileComp
UI --> MatchingComp
UI --> MessagingComp
UI --> SharedComp

ProfileComp --> DB : users, profile_pictures
MatchingComp --> DB : current_swipes, swipe_history, matches
MessagingComp --> DB : message_threads, messages
SharedComp --> DB : settings

MatchingComp ..> ProfileComp : reads users
MessagingComp ..> MatchingComp : reads matches\n(no match = no messaging)
SharedComp ..> ProfileComp : controls ethics toggle
SharedComp ..> MatchingComp : controls ethics toggle
SharedComp ..> MessagingComp : controls ethics toggle

note top of SharedComp
  Settings UI is the single place
  where all 3 ethics toggles can be
  disabled - satisfies the "single
  setting" requirement in each FR
end note

note bottom of MessagingComp
  Messaging is gated by Matching:
  users can only message someone
  they have matched with
end note

@enduml
